Revision history for Mogura

0.02
    - Require 64-bit Perl on x86_64 or aarch64 Linux for both the server and scanner.
    - Report unsupported platforms as NA to CPAN Testers during configuration.

0.01
    - Initial release.
    - Check all partitions on an attached disk before showing it is safe to disconnect.
    - Configure scanner paths, exclusions and per-command and upload timeouts with YAML or CLI options.
